Pacific Squadron @PROJECT_VERSION@ - Windows prebuilt package
===============================================================

Windows x64, fully self-contained: SDL3 is bundled in bin\ and the C++
runtime is statically linked into the executable, so nothing else needs
to be installed.

Run without installing:

    bin\pacific-squadron.exe

Or run the installer (Pacific-Squadron-@PROJECT_VERSION@-windows-x64.exe,
available separately) for Start Menu / desktop shortcuts and an entry in
"Add or remove programs".

Save games, settings and the sprite/SFX caches live in
%APPDATA%\pacific-squadron\pacific-squadron (delete that folder for a
clean slate).

Licenses: the game is MIT (LICENSE.pacific-squadron.txt); the bundled
SDL3 library is zlib (LICENSE.txt).
